This innovative system prioritizes road safety by leveraging cutting-edge technology to enhance accident response. It utilizes a Raspberry Pi as the central processing unit, integrated with a GPS module and a suite of sensors (including but not limited to accelerometers, gyroscopes, and alcohol sensors) to proactively mitigate accident risks.
Key functionalities include:
Real-time Location Tracking: The GPS module pinpoints the vehicle's location and transmits it to designated contacts (family members, emergency services) in real-time, enabling swift response.
Proactive Accident Prevention: The system incorporates sensors to detect potential hazards such as drunk driving, drowsy driving, and failure to wear seatbelts, triggering immediate alerts to the driver.
Enhanced Accident Response: In the event of an accident, the system automatically triggers an alert, providing real-time location data to emergency responders, minimizing response times and potentially saving lives.
This system aims to significantly reduce accident response times, enhance driver safety, and ultimately contribute to a decrease in road fatalities.
